      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = 3 x^{3} + x + 1 \\). Find the value of c in the open interval \\( (1, 5) \\) at which the instantaneous rate of change of f equals the average rate of change of f over \\( \\left[1, 5\\right] \\). Give the exact value.",
